  m_text: "Soru3\n\u201CH\xFCcrenin i\xE7inde ya\u015Flanm\u0131\u015F organeller
    ve at\u0131k maddeler birikmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131. H\xFCcre yava\u015Fl\u0131yor.\u201D\nHangi
    \xE7\xF6z\xFCm daha etkilidir?\n\nA) Sentrozomlar\u0131 onarmak\nB) Ribozomlar\u0131n
    say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131rmak\nC) Lizozomu aktifle\u015Ftirip sindirim
    yapmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flamak \nD) Golgi ayg\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCtmek\n\n"
