  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Soru2\n\u201CBitki h\xFCcresinde fotosentez h\u0131z\u0131 d\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015F
    durumda. H\xFCcre yeterli \u0131\u015F\u0131k al\u0131yor, su ve karbondioksit
    miktar\u0131 normal. Ancak kloroplastlar \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 verimli
    kullanam\u0131yor.\u201D\nBu durumu \xE7\xF6zmek i\xE7in hangi m\xFCdahale daha
    etkilidir?\n\nA) H\xFCcredeki kofullar\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCterek daha fazla su depolanmas\u0131n\u0131
    sa\u011Flamak\nB) Kloroplast\u0131 onarmak  \nC) Golgi ayg\u0131t\u0131n\u0131n
    paketleme h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131rmak\nD) Mitokondriye daha fazla oksijen
    g\xF6ndermek\n"
