  m_text: "\t\tH\xFCcre Zar\u0131\n\n 1. Yap\u0131s\u0131nda karbonhidrat, protein
    ve ya\u011F bulunur.\n\n2. Her maddeyi h\xFCcrenin i\xE7ine almad\u0131\u011F\u0131
    i\xE7in ona se\xE7ici ge\xE7irgen denir."
